{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>消委會．慳電｜比冷氣機更耗電！4大家電食電怪、盡快行動避免年燒萬6電費｜天氣漸漸升溫，不少家庭都開始要長開冷氣，電費就自不然貴，其實與不少人家中都有些隱型「食電獸電器」，用的機會少、卻每天在偷偷吃電！其中一款最高一年可以16,000電費！快來看看它的的真面目，盡快調整設定、改善用電習慣囉，救救荷包！</p><p>電熱水壺</p><p>一天的耗電量可能比雪櫃更多，5公升電熱水壺，1日約消耗1度電，如此一來每月就吃了40蚊電費，一年足足要花480元。反正夏天喝熱水的頻率較低，可考慮多買一個真空壺，熱水煲好後就關機，將熱水移過去備用。嫌麻煩也可換一個有真空隔熱的電熱水壺，這類機在煲滾水後會自動關電及密封，以防熱力流失，比舊型更慳電。</p><p>電熱水壺慳電｜5個使用心得+選購貼士｜消委會15款評測</p><figure><img alt=\"電熱水壺耗電量大，可多買一個真空壺，熱水煲好後就關機，將熱水移過去備用。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867770135090302976460723.jpeg/57EppBhfjPAWKzIvQsipHcZTa8XQHbMCTHGZvUxxmb0\"/><figcaption>電熱水壺耗電量大，可多買一個真空壺，熱水煲好後就關機，將熱水移過去備用。</figcaption></figure><p>還有一說，長插電熱水壺任由它不斷翻煲水，飲多了還有機會致癌！如果飲落有金屬味就非常危險？馬上點擊圖片、了解一下：</p><figure><img alt=\"（01美術製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201218/416603742800973824621849.jpeg/JaU5OjSe8Ve3_SXIxWzaZ0Ir0DgDJf00np7k3p6e5N4\"/><figcaption>（01美術製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01美術製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201218/416603745686786048601935.jpeg/j4GlLiBfB8OJ-N3GssZrnw5c2ybZj0uZIpIK4yKSCuM\"/><figcaption>（01美術製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01美術製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201218/416603748224471040475138.jpeg/g3hUTGI3NkrhIRDezRZkYMmlIRl3mLm9eDvQPHg70Dw\"/><figcaption>（01美術製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01美術製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201218/416603750934122496579160.jpeg/QBm-RxelMC25fXHW-us8ejfYiUzovpb5W2RXPltkVz4\"/><figcaption>（01美術製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01美術製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201218/416603753757020160469052.jpeg/NLKd6i108rBmULHC_VGHZ8RhqKhScXiy0vm_AtL5vwI\"/><figcaption>（01美術製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01美術製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201218/416603756332453888814763.jpeg/_ZM5-xPPhxc466Dlzyg0A7v60FFEkkUOZ4MGoGeDBqA\"/><figcaption>（01美術製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01美術製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201218/416603759105019904409762.jpeg/q7GzQvxJkRYYNJfBPHlfHRlroKpANAGy-k7Q9PpO0PQ\"/><figcaption>（01美術製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01美術製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201218/416603761856614400257869.jpeg/xJBNUMj6G6no8Av7ALMQgrwG1BoYWH5JTok4yE6JOMg\"/><figcaption>（01美術製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>電熱水爐</p><p>電熱水爐翻熱1次約需10度電，當水溫下降時它又會自動翻熱。如果由它長開不熄爐，師傅表示理論上會翻煲3次＝30度電，用最粗略的方法計就等如30日＝900度電，1357元電費！一年你就要用16284元去養這頭食電獸。</p><p>林超英拍片教沖涼慳電3貼士｜即熱式熱水爐竟然比儲水式更節能？</p><figure><img alt=\"如果長期開著電熱水爐、一年你就要用16284元去養這頭食電獸。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867771849612726272678310.jpeg/FKC5PE6P6hV01ZOPMp4vMj104E2e-QNZ64rssOuK7LA\"/><figcaption>如果長期開著電熱水爐、一年你就要用16284元去養這頭食電獸。</figcaption></figure><p>雪櫃</p><p>過期舊雪櫃都沒有自動調節，屬於定頻款式，總之插電掣就開始燒電，以250公升容量的雪櫃計，舊型1年要花500元左右電費，而一級能源標籤的新型雪櫃一年僅需200元左右。另要留意，雪櫃不要放在高溫或會被日照的位置，那會令雪櫃花更多電量去降溫。</p><p>雪櫃24小時長開好嘥電？3招雪櫃慳電貼士　食物塞太爆有一問題</p><figure><img alt=\"一級能源標籤的新型雪櫃一年僅花200元左右電費。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867773316025290752941738.jpeg/b24qVcz0goOHUJxK0lQ4uR2yI1gxRV6pjJE7IYyROyE\"/><figcaption>一級能源標籤的新型雪櫃一年僅花200元左右電費。</figcaption></figure><p>機頂盒</p><p>跟電訊商寬頻簽合約時，都會加送一些免費電視台服務，並在你家中鋪設了機頂盒，看的機會少，但卻忘了拔走火牛，任由它在燒電。原來一個機頂盒開24小時，有機會使用10幾度電；而且長期埋在電視機後，又熱又多塵，火牛也有過熱危險，唔睇應該馬上關電。</p><p>國產Android機頂盒藏惡意軟件　插電屋企網絡即被駭　2千萬人中招</p><figure><img alt=\"還有各式非法收看節目的機頂盒，既燒電又犯法。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867776429926912000450239.jpeg/vOW24nL8XFHMF6iAvW-8Ir4BfxPXGJdgsXt6OrF7ejo\"/><figcaption>還有各式非法收看節目的機頂盒，既燒電又犯法。</figcaption></figure><p>日式電子廁板</p><p>雖然少，但近十年也有很多家庭選用了可以「洗pat pat」的日式電子免治馬桶，日本天氣冷，會細心的長期加熱廁板以防用家冷親pat pat，但這細心設定背後就是24小時長期開發熱線，夏天可以索性將它關閉，以防白白浪費電力。家中哪7樣家電最耗電　冷氣並非第一名　各種家電慳電貼士👇👇</p><p>熱水爐慳電｜全屋最食電隱藏真兇！台電教電熱水爐3招慳電大法</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867775327122755584234607.jpeg/JbvAjnsiFFVNSy6i8YePuPndMnKQ14kclgNajpYDWo4\"/><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470286656966656264315.png/XAlrAL8eUUjCpnM1EfeHjTgvRmlTrN-OigQ6zYoEOs0\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Filmreal Studio/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470289307897856307542.png/9BfwQsvpUv8GA7lkBmcNRtn1oyrGq_QDlBIJMpQSCTI\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Filmreal Studio/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Filmreal Studio/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470292344705024251708.png/srdMTX_xpaW0mgreQChWspLb75wkpbj1GOGLuxjhi7s\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Filmreal Studio/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：MChe Lee/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470295805136896851793.png/03z-yZ4hNVJqUXyR11NsK7hFNVzNHFtoyT2xBck9sQU\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：MChe Lee/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：MChe Lee/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210810/501824839531630592617934.png/NiuZdxq0Yyb5OQVAjqEZD76SVt4P-mhu5CADUeQgA1E\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：MChe Lee/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：MChe Lee/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470301090222080468312.png/0NefIbY0bNu8q64Zviv8i4b91YXkDae7ISwTWiEsE1o\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：MChe Lee/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Roam In Color/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470303606935552596134.png/a0fOVVMI6KjO5ly9r77ZJf3TyuHhWQ2oIJzVhiCc1YY\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Roam In Color/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Roam In Color/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470308757803008247085.png/tjXvLVFT0erhOtPOGg_86ZGC9-qkhS1ypdFwXKXRcFw\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Roam In Color/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：nrd/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470286413697024736894.png/dll4Qfb_3wpb_k3B6spNplswJklv2wUGzLRPJcy0TyU\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：nrd/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：nrd/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470289207234560579324.png/Nv8yZQiI4BW2O5H9QUZHh8f2WDWAsRH_D3rr0g9669I\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：nrd/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：nrd/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470291786862592807654.png/gClFScroBiq-e3XISTfZE_013KNe56Bns9hR17PYUdc\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：nrd/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：nrd/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470294462959616874091.png/0jv9TkpADq_785fUQXUbYHE00dQJQxWa5IsBVeSLAVU\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：nrd/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Cong Wang/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210812/502546895743225856408257.png/bjX9FCBodwa7Y48iI8vwPHs-i2XbNzyApNSM5aTUjOU\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Cong Wang/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Cong Wang/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210810/501824954732384256632159.png/B_IFr6Cv0URcT8dnEinnDyMlRbkIiHTcPGFBaDxhQWg\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Cong Wang/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Broadway）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470302281535488067534.png/oidBilMvJpjNu76ePTqLqzuELlyhxajD9wfDifcHw4k\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Broadway）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Broadway）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470306832617472795326.png/PfYH8FuZXMWMpS1QDWxVQBO1hE1JuGmyvnuxkr57sZI\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Broadway）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Broadway）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470309491937280549318.png/Vgm5LrATgENmvefx5_SE2akZCcGbCVdrhXxcZYV8XGU\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Broadway）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Broadway）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470286711492608135827.png/_1JnvLSBT_BnISl8HqgXUmuDUnhNmmOddEkTynRJE8o\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Broadway）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Broadway）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210810/501825052753268736987430.png/A0zcj8KQqbs217NyisWCG4otdOajMeCjYXXzCWF18wk\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Broadway）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Broadway）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210810/501825107165974528216598.png/2lx4Xmlc-z9dFpDMI8sa4Sbk9ChfjTD96e8_AenvPwE\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Broadway）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Jonas Leupe/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210810/501825170676125696367185.png/aQjQ8ymtBIB5cSaaL6vQvbEXCW_QHJcAnV5TYZ1eU2E\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Jonas Leupe/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Jonas Leupe/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210810/501825215387406336420398.png/TNQR6xzoaBdZc9HRZlmiuwl8cC5upOyl8dPU7vHT1O4\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Jonas Leupe/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Jonas Leupe/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210810/501825261449252864415062.png/mj5rpr91DSNqg7_ifZ6mOnLOOb2IReNpzlaOIs5WjiI\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Jonas Leupe/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Carlos Lindner/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470302948429824483062.png/X21TMGoEwsxu9YzjEvGexyz7_NfKPVCU8iI69PIiOvQ\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Carlos Lindner/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Carlos Lindner/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470305796493312304876.png/iHV4Ulr5GFO4B-rheo7h3fZqAlNEMknb_D81pfw_NaU\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Carlos Lindner/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Carlos Lindner/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210810/501825348057436160327509.png/2Pa1XHObSKqozg1_1sR6U8mpHDAbcSrjjtlhOY7ZYTk\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Carlos Lindner/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Carlos Lindner/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470310712479744450261.png/0vetNFWhAHo8VuXs2_KeXMeRVd3TSSY1rIbbBKyG2wQ\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：Carlos Lindner/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：煤氣Towngas）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470262325809152564908.png/9R6DLqFFpkiqEyV_3Va8bzVVSHGN7txSPILZIjyC2SI\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：煤氣Towngas）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：煤氣Towngas）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470265131929600562947.png/PEBx9UT7SqBykpjKj9RmCBiQr5QSHQPthQKk-4UCpPs\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：煤氣Towngas）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：煤氣Towngas）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210729/497470268202291200397452.png/q5lVtOkXUsBsELDASc6ocypWR-vLRhkdYLc_smC3P7I\"/><figcaption>7大家用電器耗電排行（01製圖，圖：煤氣Towngas）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T10:58:32.573309+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2261,"images":43,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}